WEBVTT

00:25:58.299 --> 00:26:01.490
and peak again later
as they explore new areas.

00:26:05.684 --> 00:26:09.215
That kind of experimentation
is familiar to Lynda Weinman.

00:26:09.239 --> 00:26:11.558
Lynda Weinman: I'm an autodidactic person.

00:26:11.582 --> 00:26:13.903
I always love learning new things.

00:26:13.927 --> 00:26:17.633
AG: She got her start in the 1980s
as an animator at a film studio.

00:26:18.007 --> 00:26:21.182
She often compared herself
to her higher achieving peers

00:26:21.206 --> 00:26:22.602
who were sprinting ahead.

00:26:22.626 --> 00:26:25.404
LW: I remember when I was in my 20s

00:26:25.428 --> 00:26:29.992
watching some of my friends
who were uber successful